{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51209","headline":"五言白话诗 十六 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狼多羊数少，莫畜恶儿子。\n年是无限年，你身甚急速。\n有意造罪根，无心念诸佛。\n你从何处来，脓血相和出。\n身如水上泡，暂时还却没。\n魂魄游空虚，盲人入闇窟。\n生死如江河，波浪𧉸啾唧\n（「𧉸」，斯五六四一卷作「沸」）","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}